      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " Worker (router)\n POST /v1/hosts: register, key-signed\n GET /v1/hosts: the account's host list\n POST /v1/hosts/:id/tickets: 30 s, used once\n DELETE /v1/hosts/:id: remove a host",
