    {
      "id": "2G9pMP2Zl7RJONYUY6DCi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1515,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 340.751953125,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 26206857,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 819640455,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793335159346,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " npx plx connect (run once on B)\n 1. Sign in: PKCE, or --device-code over SSH\n 2. Install ~/.parallax-plxd + service (0072)\n 3. relay/register; plxd records account sub\n 4. Turn on relay and remote, wait for online\n Also: plx connect unlink | remove | status | add",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "plxc",
      "originalText": " npx plx connect (run once on B)\n 1. Sign in: PKCE, or --device-code over SSH\n 2. Install ~/.parallax-plxd + service (0072)\n 3. relay/register; plxd records account sub\n 4. Turn on relay and remote, wait for online\n Also: plx connect unlink | remove | status | add",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qR81WT9EBHhQmpb4epDc9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1515,
      "y": 595,
      "width": 322.13671875,
      "height": 337.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 476359017,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1773156201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793335159346,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " plxd B\n - Host key P-256: hostId = JWK thumbprint\n - Control WebSocket to the relay, opened\n   with a signed, single-use time proof\n - Listener :7341, TLS, private ranges only\n - POST /api/auth/account, only while\n   relay is on:\n     every clerk-verify check (RS256, iss,\n     aud, client_id, sid, azp, exp, nbf)\n     sub == this host's account\n     iat within 60 s, own clock, 5 min skew\n - Issues a DPoP-bound admin session\n   -> /ws JSON-RPC (0007)\n - Terminals: shell, installs, CLI sign-ins\n - Reports LAN addresses as routes",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "plxdB",
      "originalText": " plxd B\n - Host key P-256: hostId = JWK thumbprint\n - Control WebSocket to the relay, opened\n   with a signed, single-use time proof\n - Listener :7341, TLS, private ranges only\n - POST /api/auth/account, only while\n   relay is on:\n     every clerk-verify check (RS256, iss,\n     aud, client_id, sid, azp, exp, nbf)\n     sub == this host's account\n     iat within 60 s, own clock, 5 min skew\n - Issues a DPoP-bound admin session\n   -> /ws JSON-RPC (0007)\n - Terminals: shell, installs, CLI sign-ins\n - Reports LAN addresses as routes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
